[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/213","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/213/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/213/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/213/events","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/213","id":6219002584,"node_id":"PR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABNAlrQw","number":213,"title":"GitHub view: lead PR rows with the draft icon and the review decision","user":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-05T07:45:35Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T07:45:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/pulls/213","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/213","diff_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/213.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/213.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #212\n\n## Problem\n\nA PR row's `[draft]` and `✓` / `✗` badges trailed the title and the assignee / reviewer names, so in a narrow column they were the first thing cut off — a draft PR and a reviewed PR looked like any other open PR.\n\n## Changes\n\n- A draft PR's state icon is a dimmed `◌` instead of the green `●` (the same hollow treatment GitHub uses). The trailing `[draft]` badge is gone.\n- A fixed one-column review mark follows the state icon: `✓` approved (green), `✗` changes requested (red), `◯` review required (yellow), blank when there is no decision. The trailing badges are gone; merged / closed rows dim the mark with the rest of the row.\n- The PR detail header carries a `DRAFT` badge next to the state (`isDraft` joins `gh pr view --json`; older caches default to `false`).\n- The row is built by `row_spans`, so the layout is unit-tested (`draft_icon_and_review_mark_lead_the_row`, `pr_header_badges_a_draft`).\n- README en/ja, the guide's `views-github.md` en/ja and the PR tape are updated; fixtures and the GitHub GIFs are re-recorded (this draft PR is the `◌` example).\n\n## Screenshot\n\n![github pr demo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/td72/vig/feat/pr-state-icons/assets/demo-github-pr.gif)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]
